      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 130,
      "topLeftY": 374,
      "bottomRightX": 606,
      "bottomRightY": 409,
      "content": "The precise calculation of the higher orders for E, $a$, and $\\omega$ will now be carried out for the simpler example of the anharmonic oscillator of the type:",
