    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 130,
      "topLeftY": 582,
      "bottomRightX": 605,
      "bottomRightY": 614,
      "content": "The quantities $a$ are again power series in $\\lambda$ whose first term (as in Eq. ??) has the form:",
